{"content":[{"c":["EXORCISM*, EXORCIST*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Art of expelling demons and evil spirits, and the practitioner of this art."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["The ability to expel or control demons was claimed by many in the ancient Near East. Aside from the miracles of Jesus recorded in the Gospels, only in ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.19.13","r":"Acts.19.13","rawR":"Acts.19.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.19.13","value":"Acts.19.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 19:13"}," is there a biblical reference to exorcism among the Jews. However in ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.16.14-23","r":"1Sam.16.14-23","rawR":"1Sam.16.14-23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.16.14-23","value":"1Sam.16.14-23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Samuel 16:14-23"}," David functioned as an exorcist by playing a lyre to cast out an evil spirit from Saul."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Demon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Demon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Demon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Demon"},"; ",{"href":"?item=DemonPossession_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"DemonPossession_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"DemonPossession_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Demon-possession"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ExorcismExorcist","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Acts 19:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.19.13","rawQueryValue":"Acts.19.13","sourceRefExact":"Acts.19.13"},{"anchorText":"1 Samuel 16:14-23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.16.14-23","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.16.14-23","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.16.14-23"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"83412b20538bee4758cb24f0483383e24a587aeb